@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Tharga Team Sample</h1>

<p>Sample application demonstrating the Tharga Team components.</p>

<RadzenCard>
    <h3>Available pages</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="team">Team Management</a> - create teams, invite members, manage roles</li>
        <li><a href="api-keys">API Keys</a> - manage team-scoped API keys</li>
        <li><a href="audit">Audit Log</a> - view audit logs with charts and filtering</li>
        <li><a href="account">Profile</a> - your profile and authentication claims, plus demo mode and "view as" (mounted at /account, not the toolkit default, to exercise <code>o.Blazor.ProfilePath</code>)</li>
        <li><a href="users">Users</a> - admin view of all users and teams (Developer role)</li>
        <li><a href="invites">Invites</a> - view and accept pending team invitations</li>
    </ul>
</RadzenCard>
